    "name":  "LED Floodlight 10W - ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835",
    "reference":  "FLACT10W-CW-91916",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED Floodlight 10W\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cb\u003e- ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835 - IP65\u003c/b\u003e: The perfect choice for powerful and durable lighting. This 10W LED projector, equipped with cutting-edge OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835 technology, offers bright and efficient lighting. With its IP65 rating, it is water and dust resistant, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the exceptional quality and performance of this category-leading floodlight!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Floodlight 10W - ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLED Floodlight - ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835\u003c/strong\u003e is an impressive lighting device made of high-quality aluminum and glass. 10W power offers powerful efficient lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMD2835 Osram Duris diode ensures optimal performance and accurate color reproduction with \u003cstrong\u003eCRI \u0026gt; 80\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e rated, resistant to water and dust, perfect for indoor and outdoor applications.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHigh-resistance oven-cured epoxy paint coating for elegant appearance and corrosion protection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy installation with all components included.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses: Outdoor lighting, security lighting, events and shows, displays and exhibitions, indoors.\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty with technical data sheets.\u003c/p\u003e",
